<h1>Welcome Letter</h1>

<p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><%= format_date(today, :long) %></p>

<p><%= @dear %></p>

<p>
  On behalf of the team at <%= @company[:name] %>, we would like to extend a warm welcome and
  express our excitement about the opportunity to work with you on your new property at
  <strong><%= @job[:full_address] %></strong>. We are committed to delivering a high-quality
  home that meets all your expectations.
</p>

<p>
  Included are several documents and links that detail the terms and conditions of our
  partnership for your review and sign:
</p>

<h2>Attached Documents & Links</h2>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-4) 0;">
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>Welcome Letter</strong>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>Consumer Building Guide</strong> -
    <a href="https://www.qbcc.qld.gov.au/sites/default/files/2021-09/guide-qbcc-consumer-building-v3.pdf" target="_blank">QBCC Consumer Building Guide</a>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>General Conditions</strong> -
    <a href="https://www.qbcc.qld.gov.au/sites/default/files/documents/template-nhc-general-conditions.pdf" target="_blank">QBCC General Conditions</a>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>QBCC Licensee Register</strong> -
    <a href="https://my.qbcc.qld.gov.au/myQBCC/s/qbcc-licensee-register" target="_blank">Check Contractor's Licence History</a>
    <span style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 0.9em;"> (Search for licence #<%= @company[:qbcc_license] %>)</span>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>QBCC Building Contract</strong>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>Specification</strong>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>Building Plans</strong>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>Owner's Authority to Obtain Information</strong>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>Specification of Works Acknowledgement</strong>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <strong>Termite Protection System</strong>
  </li>
  <li style="padding: var(--space-2) 0;">
    <strong>Colour Selection</strong>
  </li>
</ul>

<p>
  We kindly ask that you carefully review each document and sign where required. By doing so,
  you acknowledge that these documents have been thoroughly reviewed and fully understood.
  If you have any questions or require further clarification, please feel free to reach out to us.
</p>

<p>
  We are excited to begin this journey with you and are here to assist every step of the way.
</p>

<p style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">
  Best regards,<br><br>
  <strong><%= @company[:name] %> Team</strong>
</p>

<div style="margin-top: var(--space-8); padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
  <p style="margin: 0;">
    <strong><%= @job[:full_address] %></strong><br>
    Owner: <%= @client_names %>
  </p>
</div>
